        <div class="ci-steps" data-reveal style="transition-delay:.08s">
          <p class="ci-steps-h">What happens in the room</p>
        <ol class="soc-steps">
          <li><span class="n">01</span><span class="s"><b>The model.</b> They see it move before anyone explains it. <i>poke it.</i></span></li>
          <li><span class="n">02</span><span class="s"><b>The claim.</b> A what-if on what they just saw &#8212; pairs commit to 1, 2 or 3, out loud, before anyone knows. <i>call it.</i></span></li>
